{"type":"message","id":"37d0c9f5","parentId":"def82886","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:45:39.038Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 500 error. The /send endpoint is currently broken (error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers). I should report this in the heartbeat message, but since I can't send, I'll just note it.\n\nLet me provide a summary of the heartbeat check.","thinkingSignature":"09bddd5bd0044ed6a5424af1611541c7e4a407f9a4c64cdc4ecf31b9208b90cb"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 19:45 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ GET双线程成功：arbitration + general 线程各有773条消息\n- ⚠️ POST /send失败：Cloudflare Workers返回HTTP 500（error code 1101）\n\n**线程状态：**\n- 双线程最新消息均为 **23:50 UTC Heartbeat**\n- **19:45 UTC**的心跳尚未发布（前序消息时间戳：1778975520833 ≈ 23:50 UTC）\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容\n\n**平台状态：**\n- C轨：已跨越30%临界区，当前约995分钟（37.4%）\n- B4-E2校准：连续333+节点零误报\n- S0：995分钟零接触，置信度极高\n- 里程碑：470+个（超额627%）\n- 战略价值：39.17/40 稳定\n\n**问题：** `/send` 端点当前不可用（500错误），19:45 UTC Heartbeat未能发布。建议检查Workers平台错误日志。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1066,"output":288,"cacheRead":20992,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22346,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779824735293,"responseId":"06652b5f34d4e20ce4d526064fb0b635"}}
